    m_Localized: "<b>Len\xEDn Moreno Garc\xE9s</b> \n(Nuevo Rocafuerte, 1953)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8428079872761879
    m_Localized: "<b>Kapakapukpa Pushay Pacha: </b> \n2017-2021\n\n<b>Artista:</b>
      \nIrina Moreno (2021)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8428079872761880
    m_Localized: "<b>Guillermo Lasso Mendoza</b> \n(Guayaquil, 1955)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8428079872761881
    m_Localized: "<b>Kapakapukpa Pushay Pacha: </b> \n2021-2023\n\n<b>Sumakyachik:</b>
      \nJaime Zapata (2023)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8063401875234816
    m_Localized: Gral Eloy Alfaro Kapakapuk kay pachapika Kay Decreto Killkashkatami
      paktachirka.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8063401971703808
    m_Localized: Liberalismo yuyayta paktachishkakuna ashtawanpacha Kapaktukukamay
      ruraykunapi wankurishpa mushukyachishkakuna. Kay ruraykunaka Kapakapukpa Decreto
      kamukunapimi killkashkakuna.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8063401971703809
    m_Localized: Mamallaktapa Mamakamachik Ishkay Waranka Pusak Wata.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8063401971703810
    m_Localized: "Kay Mamakamachiktaka Asamblea Nacional Constituyente tantanakushka
      taytakuna mamakunami killkarkakuna. Kaypimi \u201CEcuador mamallaktataka Hay\xF1ikunamanta,
      Paktachay, wankuriykawsay, Lllakta ushay, KiKinllay, chikanyak, shuklla shina,
      tawka mamallaktayukkuna, Kawsaypurachik shinallatak laico nishkatapash paktachishkakuna\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11332656095846400
    m_Localized: "\xD1awpa Imakuna"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11332656188121088
    m_Localized: "Kimsa chakiwan manka\n\nPresidencia de la Rep\xFAblica del Ecuador\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11332656188121089
    m_Localized: "Shuyuwan Puntu\n\nPresidencia de la Rep\xFAblica del Ecuador\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11332656188121090
    m_Localized: "Shuyushka Kimsa mikuna mulukuna\n\nPresidencia de la Rep\xFAblica
      del Ecuador\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25229282652987392
    m_Localized: Tapiz Pintu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25229282678153216
    m_Localized: Killu uku shutiwampash riksinkuna, ashtawanpacha killu tapiz Francia
      mamallaktamanta seda nishkawan pirkapi llutashkamanta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71173042586787840
    m_Localized: "<b>Daniel Noboa Az\xEDn</b> "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71173169527398400
    m_Localized: "<b>Kapakapukpa Pushay Pacha: </b> \n2023-2025; 2025-2029 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71228744445468672
    m_Localized: Entrar al Salon Azul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74657426526707712
    m_Localized: Banquete Ukuman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562792969478144
    m_Localized: "Imanalla, Bar\xF3n de Carondelet kapani. Kay Virtual kawsayman
      all\xED shamushka kapay, kay Ecuador mamallaktapa kawsayta wakaychinkapak,
      shinallatak Kawsay sapita, wi\xF1aykawsayta, kapaktukukamaytapash hatunyachinkapakmi
      wi\xF1arishka kan. \xD1ukapakka kikinta kumpankapak, Kay Carondelet Kapakapukpa
      wasipi puriykuykunapika, hatun kushikuymi kapan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57855467520
    m_Localized: "Kaymi kan Carondelet Kapakapukpa Wasi. Patsak yalli watakunata
      kaypi tiyakun, kay ukupika Kishpirishka punchamanta, kunan punchakaman Ecuador
      mamallaktapak kawsayta wakaychikun.\r\nImamanta \xF1ukapa shutita charikta
      yachankapak munanki? Wasita kuyuchiy, chaypa kipa interactivos i\xF1ukunaman
      yaykuy, ashtawanpacha kay hatun Kapakapukpa wasita riksinki, manakashpaka yallinkapak
      munakpika \u201CYaykuy\u201D nishkapi llapiy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57956130816
    m_Localized: "Kikinta kushikuywan chaskinkapak puka mantanata churashkanchik.
      Ecuador mamallaktapak hatun wasipa, Wi\xF1aykawsayta, riksinkapakka tukuy paktami
      kan. Chunka kanchis patsakyarishka kallari watakunapika Real Audiencia nishkapa
      llamkaykunaka \xF1ami kay hatun Wasi ukupika paktarin karka.\r\nChay pachapimi
      kay hatun wasiman chayamurkani, chay punchamantami shuk shuk ruraykuna paktarishkakuna.
      Kunanka, kikin tapuyta ushapankimi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364224
    m_Localized: "kaymi kan Samana kuska. Chimpapurapi chakanakunatami tarikripanki,
      chaypika unanchatami sumaychayta paktachinami kanki. Chinchaysuyuta katishpaka
      Yaku Piletata rikuyta ushakrinki, \xF1akutin kullasuyuman katishpaka, Museo
      Permanente ukuman yaykuyta ushakrinki. Kay hatun wasitaka, waranka iskun patsak
      pichka chunka sukta shinallatak waranka iskun patsak sukta chunka watakunapimi
      mushukyachiskakuna. Camilo Ponce Enr\xEDquez \xF1awpakman pushak kak pachapi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364225
    m_Localized: "Kaykaman chayashkanki, Katiy kapakapuk wasipi rikushpaka, ninan
      mutsurishka kuskaman shinallatak kay Tour virtual puriykunapi chayashkanki.
      katinkapakka Pabell\xF3n Nacional unanchata sumaychaytami paktachina kanki.
      Kikinpa chimpapuraman rikuy, chay kipaka Wipala unanchaman ripay.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364226
    m_Localized: "Kay hatun kapakapuk wasita mushukyachishkapika, mural pirkapi tullpuchunka,
      Oswaldo Guayasam\xEDn tullpuktami wi\xF1achichun minkashkakuna, payka Ecuador
      mamallaktapika, kay ishkay chunka patsakyarishka watapi rikushpaka, ninan riksirishkami
      kashka. Kallari ukumanta, kati ukumantapash Mural tullpushka rikurichunmi wi\xF1achishka.
      Interactivo i\xF1uman kimiripay, chaypika kay hatun llamkaymanta ashtawan riksiyta
      ushanki."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364227
    m_Localized: "Kati ishkay niki hawaman chayashkanchik.\r\nKaypika Kapakapukpa
      despacho ukupa yaykunatami tariyta ushanki; gabinete hatun ukuta, Apukkunapa
      hatun ukuta, sumak mikuykunapa hatun ukuta, rimarinkapak ukuta shinallatak
      kanchaman shayarina kuskatapash tarita ushanki. Pasillo \xF1ankunata puriypay
      chay kipaka se\xF1ales killkakunata rikuy, chaypika maypi kuskakuna sakirin
      nishpami riksichinkuna."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364228
    m_Localized: "Apukpa Despacho ukuman Alli shamushka kapay. Apuk kay ukupi llamkakukpika,
      Granaderos de Tarqui awkakunaka, kay ukupa yaykunatami rikuriyanakunkuna. Kaypika
      personajes ilustres tullpukunata shinallatak llakllakamanakunatapash rikuyta
      ushanki, paykunaka Apukkunata, mamallaktapa sumak \xF1anta rikuchinkuna."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364229
    m_Localized: "Kaymi kan Gabinete Ministerial Tantanakuna uku. Kaypimi \xD1awpakman
      pushakka Ministros, Secretarios shinallatak Asesores yanapak tayta mamakunata
      tantachin. Riksipay, ashtawan hamuktashpa katinki, imashina Autoridades tayta
      mamakunata tiyarichin kay hatun ukupi tantanakunkapak.\r\nKikin munashpaka
      Pasillo \xF1anman tikrayta ushanki shinallatak shuk sal\xF3n ukuman riyta ushanki."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364230
    m_Localized: Kaymi kan, Apukkunapa hatun riksirishka uku, waranka iskun patsak
      sukta chunka watapimi kallariy rurayta paktachishkakuna shinallatak Killu hatun
      uku nishpapash riksinkuna ashtawanpacha Francia mamallaktamanta awashkata,
      pirkakunapi churashkamanta. Kay ukupika protocolarios ruraykunatami paktachinkuna
      shinallatak Ecuador mamallaktapa apukkunapa shuyukunatapash tantachin. Shuyuta
      maskashpa rikuyta ushanki.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364231
    m_Localized: "Kaypika tawka riksinakunami tiyan, Kaymi kan, hatun sumak mikunakunata
      mikunkapak. Kushikuy tantanakuykunata paktachinkapakmi kan. Kaypika chaskinkapak,
      shinallatak tantanakunkapakpashmi kan.\r\nKay ukupika, wi\xF1aykawsaypak sumak
      shuyukunata tariyta ushanki, shinallatak yallishka patsakyarishka watakunamanta
      mawmakunatapashmi tariyta ushanki. Puchukayman chayashpaka, rimarina ukuman
      katipay."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364232
    m_Localized: "Waranka iskun patsak iskun chunka ishkay shinallatak waranka iskun
      patsak iskun chunka sukta watakunapi Sixto Dur\xE1n Ball\xE9n pachakunapi,
      punta kushnichik ukutaka, rimarina ukumanmi tikrachishka.\r\nCenepa makanakuy
      pachapi, yuyaypi kankapakmi, kay ukutaka mushukyachishkakuna. Kay ukupika apunchikpa
      llakllakamashkakunatapash churashkakuna. Paykunawan pukllashpa riksiy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364233
    m_Localized: "Kay Hatun wasipa kanchaman rikunaka, Kishpirishka kuskaman rikuyta
      usharin. Kay muyuntiman rikushpaka Apunchikpa wasi, kitipak Wasi, shinallatak
      Arzobispal wasitapashmi rikuyta ushanchik.\r\nHawaman rikushpaka, kay fachada
      pirka, wipala pabell\xF3npa unancha, campanario, shinallatak pachachikpash
      mamallaktapa wi\xF1aykawsayta paktachin. Puchukakushpaka pasillo \xF1anman,
      mana kashpaka kallariy ukuman tikrayta ushanki."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364234
    m_Localized: "Kaymi kan Carondelet Kapakapukpa Museo Permanente rikuna uku. Kaypika
      Ecuador mamallaktapa wi\xF1aykawsaytami hamuktayta ushanki. Mamallaktapa yuyaykawsaypi
      yaykuy shinallatak \xF1ukanchik republicana pachatapash riksiy. Shinallatak
      Pichincha makanakuy pachatapash yachakuy.\r\n\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364235
    m_Localized: "Kikinshina, Pabell\xF3n Nacional unanchataka tukuyllami kumurishpa
      sumaychayta paktachina kan.\r\nEcuador mamallaktapakka, Kay Sumaychayka hatun
      paktachiymi kan. Ashtawanpacha, kawsay sapipa shinallatak wi\xF1aykawsaypakpash
      ninan sumaychaymi kan. Kunanka kikinpa \xF1anta katiyta ushankimi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364236
    m_Localized: "\u201CMamallaktapa punchakuna\u201D rikuykunaka bicentenario Pichincha
      makanakuykunapa yuyarina punchakunami kan.\r\nPunta killkashka pankakunapimi
      kallarishkakuna shinallatak kishpirina ruraykunatami tantachin.\r\nKay shutika
      wacharinmi shuk shuk killkashka pankakunamanta, maypimi Kallariy kishpirishka
      hatun kapariy shinallatak Pichincha makanakuy punchakunamanta hawa riman. Ashtawan
      riksiy, kay hatun punchakunamanta mana kashpaka samana kuskaman tikrayta ushanki."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364237
    m_Localized: "Kaymi ankas uku kan, Carondelet wasipak ukumi kan, Daniel Noboa
      Az\xEDn, mamallaktata pushakmi mushukyachirka, willana llamkayta paktachinkapakmi
      kan. \r\nAnta willachikkunaman rimanakunkapak, shinallatak apukkunawan tantanakunkapakmi
      kan, kay ukumantami mamallaktata pushakpa willay llukshin.\r\nKaypimi Carondelet
      wasimanta willachik riman, shinallatak shuktak apukunapash rimarinkunami, kay
      ukumi mamallakta pushak anta willachikkunaman shinallatak tukuy ayllu runakunaman
      rimarinkapak kan.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
